{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Retail Revenge \u2014 where &quot;The customer is always right&quot; ends at the door.</strong><br>Take on the role of a retail store worker trying to survive the daily chaos. Manage the shop, scan items, stock shelves \u2014 or lose your mind and fight back when customers push too far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You choose how the story plays out:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay calm and run the store like a pro.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap under pressure and pick up a weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix retail management with brutal stress relief!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re scanning groceries, fighting off angry mobs, or just trying to survive another shift, every day in <i>Retail Revenge</i> is unpredictable.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2979470?t=1746679276","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2979470?t=1746679276","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979470/34d0970a7e6c9fbc797a8f6393d88599ac4c09b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746679276","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979470/34d0970a7e6c9fbc797a8f6393d88599ac4c09b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746679276","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains strong language, violence, and dark humor. Customers may verbally abuse the player. Players have the option to assault or kill customers using a variety of weapons, including swords, blunt objects, explosives, and drugs to incapacitate them before delivering a fatal blow."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcom